  "rationale": "w29/city-and-supply-chain: the single materials scalar became three kinds (food, stone, vellum), and the wire from knowledge to the economy was connected for the first time. Every baseline in this repository was recorded against a build in which resourceYieldBonuses was a hardcoded empty array and advanceConstruction had no caller outside its own tests, so both economy primitives were unreachable by any path. Content also gained form yieldWeights and territory yieldPerLandUnit, which moves contentRevision and invalidates the provenance of all three files on its own.",
